WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Cut the arms: Prepare card links with pivot spacings 4, 10 and 9 cm.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Mark the base: Mark two fixed pivots 11 cm apart on a rigid card base.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Add the fasteners: Join the links with four loose split pins.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.800
Rotate the input: Turn the short 4 cm crank slowly. Watch the output arm rock.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Measure angles: Mark output angles for several crank positions.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Experiment: Change one link length and observe how motion changes.

